{
 "_note": "动态提醒 · 边沿(doc/ccusage-live-timeline.md §6.2)。有一路 Claude Code 可能卡住了:连续 ≥5 次工具失败 / 一轮跑了 >40 分钟且 >80 次工具调用 / 一轮里上下文压缩了 ≥2 次 / 等你授权 >15 分钟(判据在服务端 stuckOf)。\n事件键 = 设备:会话:原因:轮号 —— 同一轮同一种原因只响一次;换了原因(先连续失败、后来又打转)会再响一次。只是信号,文案写「可能卡住」。检查节律同 waiting,不承诺实时。",
 "version": 1,
 "id": "stuck",
 "title": "可能卡住提醒",
 "sub": "Claude Code 会话连续失败、长时间打转或反复压缩上下文时提醒",
 "i18n": {
  "en-US": {
   "title": "Stuck session alert",
   "sub": "Tells you when a Claude Code session keeps failing, spins for a long time or keeps compacting its context",
   "message": {
    "title": "${sProj} may be stuck",
    "body": "${sWhy}"
   }
  }
 },
 "events": {
  "onClick": "/live"
 },
 "task": {
  "depends": [
   {
    "flow": "@[file://xJob/flow/alert.df]",
    "params": {
     "perm": "3",
     "long": "10"
    }
   }
  ],
  "then": {
   "flow": "@[file://xJob/flow/edge.df]",
   "params": {
    "key": "${stuckKey}",
    "slot": "stuck"
   }
  },
  "refresh": {
   "interval": [
    "300"
   ]
  }
 },
 "alert": {
  "level": "normal",
  "message": {
   "title": "${sProj} 可能卡住了",
   "body": "${sWhy}"
  }
 }
}
